t by our experts, the desired wallet will be charged.",WAIT_FOR_PROCESS_WITHDRAW_CASH_PAYMENT:"Dear user, after reviewing and confirming your request by our experts, the amount will be delivered to the desired recipient",WAIT_FOR_PROCESS_WITHDRAW_PAYMENT_REQUEST:"Dear user, after reviewing and confirming your request by our experts, the amount will be credited to the desired account",WAIT_FOR_PROCESS_WITHDRAW_BANK_PAYMENT_REQUEST:"Your withdrawal Request has been submitted.\nPlease note that all the Rial withdrawals in Topchange are processed and done via PAYA banking system. So you have to wait till the evening of the next day in order to receive your amount. Obviously there will be no settelments ftom PAYA system on fridays and public holidays.\nAlso be aware that after the completion of your request, Topchange will only deduct the amount from your wallet when it is confirmed that you have received the amount in your account. No withdrawal request can be cancelled after submission.",WAIT_FOR_PROCESS_WITHDRAW_BANK_PAYMENT_REQUEST2:"Please wait until the evening of next day to receive your amount and only get in contact with the support department after the aformentioned time.",WAIT_TILL_ACCEPT_PAYMENT:"Please wait for payment confirmation by experts",WHAIT_FOR_ASSIGN_PAYMENT:"Please wait for payment information from experts.",WITHDRAWAL_POINT_SUCCESS:"The points were withdrawn successfully and the amount was deposited in the desired wallet.",MIN_ORDER:"The minimum order must be greater than {{value}}",MAX_ORDER:"The maximum order must be less than {{value}}",NEED_VERIFY:"For using this section you should do needed verifications",REQUEST_SUCCESS_WAITING:"Your request has been submitted and is currently under review.",ALERT_REQUEST_SUCCESS_WAITING_TEXT:"Your request will be reviewed within the next few hours, and the requested wallet balance will be updated accordingly."},SELECTED_WALLET:"Selected ",CURRENCY:"Currency",NOTIFY:{TITLE:{DEPOSIT_E_MONEY:"Deposit (E-money