ATE:"Registration date",SELECT_ONE_BELOW_OPTIONS:"Please select one of the following options",STATE:"State",TAKE_IMAGE:"Take picture",TAKE_NEW_ONE:"Take a new picture",TAKE_PIC_DESCRIPTION:"Dear user, in order to prevent any violations and maintain the security of transactions, send us your photo with the following specifications. <br/>* All information should be written on white paper automatically.<br/>* Photo size less than 2 MB. <br/> <div class='title'>1- White sheet</div> Take a white sheet with the information specified in the image in front of you. <br/> <div class='title'>2- Attach ID card</div>- Attach your ID card to the sheet as you see in the picture. <br/> <div class='title'>3-Code</div> The code shown in Write the following form in your own handwriting on the sheet. <br/> <div class='title'>4- Text</div>- I, ......................., with national ID ..........., have sent my document to authenticate my identification at  Topchange website on ../../.. . I confirm that I did not provide this information to anyone else, and I have agreed not to buy or sell cryptocurrencies or fiat funds for any third parties. I understand and agree to all of the responsibilities that comes throughout my participation in both mentioned websites. <br/> <div class='title'>5-Signature</div> Your signature.",TITLE:"Profile",UPLOAD_DRIVING_PHOTO:"Choose drivering license image",UPLOAD_IDENTITY_CARD_PHOTO:"Upload identity card",UPLOAD_FRONT_OF_YOUR_IDENTITY_CARD_IMAGE:"Upload front of your identity card image",UPLOAD_BACK_OF_YOUR_IDENTITY_CARD_IMAGE:"Upload back of your identity card image",UPLOAD_IMAGE:"Choose image",UPLOAD_IMAGE_FROM_YOUR_STORAGE:"Upload from your system memory",UPLOAD_PASSPORT_PHOTO:"Choose passport image",UPLOAD_PHOTO_OF_PASSPORT:"Upload passport image",USER_GROUP:"User group",USE_CAMERA_TO_TAKE_IMAGE:"Use your phone's camera to take a picture.",VERIFICATION:"Verification",VERIFIED:"Verified",VERIFIED2:"Verified",VERIFY_CURRENT_PHONE_NUMBER:"Confirm current