een sent and our experts will contact you within 2 hours. Please be patient.",PHONECALL_INTERVIEW_DONE:"You have successfully passed the phone call interview!",PHONECALL_INTERVIEW_REJECTED:"Your request Rejected",PHONECALL_INTERVIEW_CONFIRM_DES:"Dear user, please note that the verification of telephone calls is only for the following  is required, otherwise you will not need to do this verification:",SUPPORT:"Support",SUSPENDED:"Suspended",SUSPEND_ALERT:"Your request wallet",SKIP:"Skip",ERROR:{PASSWORD_MIN_LENGTH:"Password must contain at least {{value}} characters",PASSWORD_MAX_LENGTH:"maximum length of password is {{value}} characters",PASSWORD_IS_NOT_SAME:"Confirmation of new password is different to new password."},REQUESTS_TYPE:{DEPOSIT_E_MONEY:"Deposit by local payment",DEPOSIT_MONEY_CURRENCY:"Deposit by E-Money",EXCHANGE_MONEY_CURRENCY:"Exchange(Tc-Wallet)",WITHDRAWAL_POINT:"Withdrawal point",SEND_E_MONEY:"Send E-Money",SEND_TC_WALLET:"Send from Tc-Wallet",SEND_MONEY_CURRENCY:"Send by local payment",VOUCHER:"Buy Voucher",WITHDRAWAL_E_MONEY:"Withdrawal by E-Money",WITHDRAWAL_MONEY_CURRENCY:"Withdrawal by local payment"},VERIFY:{VERIFY:"Verify",REQUIRED:"Required",OPTIONAL:"Optional",TYPE:{ADDRESS:"Address information",PERSONAL:"Personal information",PERSONAL_IDENTITY:"Personal information",PERSONAL_PASSPORT:"Personal information",DRIVER_LICENSE:"Personal information",PHOTO_UPLOAD:"Photo information",PHOTO_CAMERA:"Photo information",PHOTO:"Photo"},NOTIFY:{TITLE:{VERIFY_INFO:"Information verification"},NOTIFICATION:{BODY:{ACCEPTED:"Your {{0}} has been verified.",REJECTED:"Your {{0}} has been rejected."}},KYC:{NOTIFICATION:{TITLE:{ACCEPTED:"KYC Authentication",REJECTED:"KYC Authentication"},BODY:{REJECTED:"Your identity has been rejected in the system.",ACCEPTED:"Your identity has been verified successfully in the system."}}}},KYC:{INFORMATION:"Information",ENTER_TO_KYC:"Enter to KYC",IRANIAN_USERS_CONFIRM_ALERT:"If your document's issuing country is Iran, please enter your name and family in Persian.",DESCRIPTION:"Dear user, in order to increase security and prevent any profiteering violations, please do your verification",ALERT_ERROR:"Unfortunately your authentication is failed, please contact support team",ALERT_DONE:"Your authentication has been completed successfully.",ALERT_WAITING:"Completing the authentication process ..."},LETTER_OF_COMMITMENT:{ALERT_DONE:"You have successfully submitted your commitment letter.",ALERT_MISS_MATCH_DATA:"Unfortunately your authentication is failed, please contact support team",TEXT:"I, <strong>{{name}}</strong>, with the national number <strong>{{code}}</strong>, sent my documents to Top Change for verification, and I confirm that the registration was completed by me. I also agree not to accept cash or digital currency in any form in return for having anyone to use my account. I confirm that I have not given anybody else my bank account details, and that if I receive an illegal deposit, I will be held legally liable, including legal penalties and compensation for the plaintiff.",CONFIRM_CHECKBOX:"I confirm the above information",MISS_MATCH_DATA:"Miss Match Data"}},ALERT:{ADDRESS_HAS_BEEN_UPDATED:"Your address information was successfully updated.",ADDRESS_IS_OPTIONAL:"Please first fill in the address information form to activate the personal information confirmation section for you",ADDRESS_UPLOAD_HINT:"Note: To confirm the address, upload a clear scan of one of the valid documents such as this year's bill (landline, water, electricity, gas), title deed or vehicles, lease and insurance policy. To confirm the information, the address entered in the system and the information on the submitted bill must be the same",ADDRESS_VERIFYED:"Your address has been successfully verified",ADDRESS_VERIFY_IS_PENDING:"Your address information is being reviewed by our experts.",DOCUMENTS_UPLOADED:"Documents uploaded successfully",ERROR_ADDRESS_INFO_NOT_VERIFIED:"Your address information has not been ve