ot be less than {{value}}",SELECT_WALLET_FIRST:"Please select your desired wallet",AMOUNT_CANT_BE_MORE_THAN_BALANCE:"Amount cannot be more than wallet balance",AMOUNT_CANT_BE_MORE_THAN_ADV_AMOUNT:"The requested amount cannot be more than the total amount of the advertisement",AMOUNT_CANT_BE_LESS_THAN_TEN:"The requested amount cannot be less than 10 {{value}} .",AMOUNT_CANT_BE_LESS_THAN:"The requested amount cannot be less than {{value}} {{currency}} .",AMOUNT_CANT_BE_SET_ZERO:"The requested amount cannot be zero",AMOUNT_CANT_BE_MORE_MAX_PAY:"The requested amount cannot be more than {{amount}} {{currency}}"},DESCRIPTION:{RELEASE_PROPERTY:"Please release your sold property within the specified time. Otherwise, the buyer will refer to the support and after checking the platform experts will transfer the sold currency to the buyer's wallet.",PAYMENT_LIMIT:"Due to the limit of payment through card to card, it is possible that the buyer has used several bank cards, so be careful in checking the deposit information.",INFORMATION_DISCREPANCY:'In case of any discrepancies in the seller\'s payment information, do not release your currency and click the "Incorrect information" button. We will not be responsible for refunding your payment in case of wrong release.',IMPORTANT_INFORMATION:"Do not give your sensitive bank information to users so that people do not misuse it.",TRANSFORM_THROUGH_CHANNEL:"You should never use any form of money transfer that advertises through third party channels such as social networks or messengers or face-to-face advertisements. The platform cannot be held responsible for any damages that occur outside of the platform. Also, the platform has no P2P anywhere.",PAYMENT_SPECIFIED_TIME:'Please make your payment in the specified time and make sure to click the "Paid, Next" button. After the seller confirms the payment, the system transfers the digital asset to your account.',POSSIBLE_MULTIPLE_CARD:"Due to the card-to-card payment limit, it is possible to use several bank cards.",DEPOSIT_FROM_ACCOUNT:"Note that you must deposit money from the bank account of your choice. In case of any discrepancy in the payment information, the seller will not release his currency and will not be responsible for returning your payment.",DEPOSIT_AMOUNT_CORRECTLY:"Be careful when depositing money, deposit the amount correctly. If the deposit amount is low, the platform will deposit currency equivalent to your deposit amount into your wallet. Also, if you deposit more than the specified amount, try to talk to the seller and solve your problem. The platform will not be responsible in this regard.",AFTER_EACH_PAYMENT:"Note that after each payment, enter your card number, tracking number (referral) and payment amount, and also upload a photo of your payment receipt in the embedded place.",PAYMENT_RECEIPT:"Please keep your payment receipt at the end of the transaction",PAY_ATTENTION:"Pay attention to the remaining time for payment.",PAY_WITH_BANK:"To pay with a bank card, you can send the amount using one or multiple cards.",NOTE_BANK_CARDS:"Note that all bank cards used must be in your name. Otherwise, the seller may refuse the payment, the transaction could be canceled, and the platform will not be responsible.",ENSURE_AMOUNT_SEND:"Ensure that the amount you send is neither more nor less than the required amount. If it is, the platform will need to contact the seller, and resolving the issue may take a long time.",AFTER_PAYMENT:"After each payment, enter your card number, the reference number, and the amount paid, and also upload a picture of the payment receipt in the designated area.",PAYMENT_RECEIPTS:"Please keep your payment receipts until the transaction is complete.",CONDUCT_TRANSACTION:"Under no circumstances should you conduct a transaction involving the transfer of money through a third-party channel such as social networks, messaging apps, or face-to-face deals. The platform cannot be held responsible for any losses or damages resulting from transactions made outside the platform.",ADDITIONALLY:"Additionally, the platform does not interfere in P2P transactions and merely provides the infrastructure for your transactions."},CUSTOMER_PAYMENT_INFORMATION:"Customer Payment Information",PAYMENT_INFORMATION:"Payment Information",TOO_MUCH_DEPOSITED:"",EXCESS_AMOUNT:"Excess amount",REMAINING_RELEASE_TIME:"Remaining Release Time",CHAT_WITH_SUPPORT:"Chat with support",ENTER_YOUR_MESSAGE:"Enter your message",CONFIRMATION:{CONFIRMING:"Please note that confirming the above message means receiving the money in full and confirming the correctness of the buyer's payment information.",DISCREPANCIES:"Please contact support if you see any discrepancies.",AFTER_CONFIRMING:"After confirming this message, your money will be released and the platform will not be responsible for it."},EMAIL_CODE:"Email Code",SENT_EMAIL_TEXT:"Enter the 6-digit code sent to {{value}}.",ADVERTISE:{SEARCH:"Search",CURRENCY_TYPE:"Currency",CURRENCY_AMOUNT:"Desired Amount",DESIRED_AMOUNT:"Desired Amount",ACTIVE_ADVERTISES:"Active ads",SELLER:"Seller",TRANSACTION:"Transaction",COMPLETE:"Complete",EXCHANGE_RATE:"Exchange rate",SELL_AMOUNT:"Selling price",SELL:"Sale",MIN:"At least",PAYMENT_METHOD:"Payment Method",BUY_CURRENCY:"Buy Currency",BUY:"Buy",ADVERTISE:"Advertisements",VIDEOHELP:"Video guide",CREATE_ADVERTISE:"Make an ad",MY_ORDERS:"My orders",ENTER_AMOUNT:"Enter the currency amount",PAID_VALUE:"Your payment amount",SELECT_WALLET:"Choose a wallet",USER:"User",ORDER:"Order",COMPLETED:"Completed",AVAILABLE:"Available",TIME_LIMIT:"Deposit time limit",MINUTE:"Minutes",CANCEL:"Cancel",DOLLAR:"Dollar",RIAL:"Rial",DERHAM:"Derham",EURO:"Euro",DERHAM_WALLET:"Derham Wallet",EURO_WALLET:"Euro Wallet",DOLLAR_WALLET:"Dollar Wallet ",EMPTY_DATA:"Not found",ORDER_BY:"Sort by",NewestListing:"Newest Ads",LowestPrice:"Lowest exchange rate ",HighestAmount:"Highest Quantity",DEALS:"Deals",SUCCESSFUL:"Successful",AMOUNT:"Amount"},BUYER_INFORMATION:"Buyer information",ENTERED_VALUE_EXCEEDS_LIMITS:"The entered value exceeds the allowable limit",MINIMUM_ALLOWED_AMOUNT:"The minimum allowable amount is {{number}} {{currency}}",VIEW_MY_ORDERS:"View my orders",MY_AD_INFO:"My ad info",DETAILS:"Details",REQUESTED_FOR_SALE:"Amount requested for sale",SALABLE_AMOUNT:"Salable amount",COLLATERAL_AMOUNT:"collateral amount ({{value}}%)",COMMISSION:"commission ({{value}}%)",EQUIVALENT_RIAL:"Equivalent Rial",MINIMUM_PURCHASE:"Minimum purchase per order",CARD_TO_CARD:"Card to Card",SATNA:"Satna",PAYA:"Paya",BUYER_DIPOSIT_LIMIT:"Buyer deposit time limit",ADVERTISING_PERIOD:"Advertising period",VIEW_PAYMENTS:"View payments",ORDER_COMPLETED:"Your order has been completed",SHARE_YOUR_EXPERIENCE:"Please share your experience with us.",PAYMENTS:"Payments",PURCHASE_INFO:"My sales information",PAYMENT_INFO:"My payment information",NEXT:"Next",STEPPER:{PURCHASE_AMOUNT:"Purchase Amount Determination",SALES_DETERMINATION:"Sales Determination",COMMITMENT_LATER:"Commitment letter",CONFIRM_INFORMATION:"Confirm information",ADVERTISEMENT_REGISTRATION:"Advertisement registration",CURRENCY_RECEIPT:"Currency receipt",PAYMENT:"Payment"},ENTER_CURRENCY_AMOUNT:"Enter the currency amount",CURRENCY_AMOUNT:"Currency Amount",DOLLAR:"Dollar",PAYMENT_AMOUNT:"Your payment amount",RIAL:"Rial",CHOOSE_WALLET:"Choose a wallet",CHOOSE_BANK_ACCOUNT:"Choose Bank Account",USER_DOT:"User:",DIPOSIT_DOT:"Diposit:",TRANSFER_RATE_DOT:"Transfer rate:",PAYMENT_METHOD_DOT:"Payment method:",DIPOSIT_TIME_LIMIT_DOT:"Deposit time limit:",BUY_CURRENCY:"Buy Currency",COMMITMENT_LATER_DESCRIPTION:{RESPONSIBLE_FOR_AD:"Be truthful and fair, treat others with utmost respect, and take responsibility for your ads.",SALLER_PRICE_BUYER:"The price of the orders established between the seller and the buyer is final and non-negotiable",SPECIFIED_TIME:"Please complete your release within the specified time. If this time expires, you should be accountable to the buyer and the support team. In case of non-response, the platform is allowed to release the advertisement amount",CONTROLLED_ASSETS_PLATFORM:"Your payment goes directly to the seller's account and only the digital asset that the seller wants to sell during the transaction is controlled by the platform.",DIPOSIT_FROM_ACCOUNT:"Note that the received amount must be deposited from the same account mentioned in the payment form. In case of discrepancy, do not perform the release in any way and contact the support. If the platform is released It has no responsibility for the released amount",DIPOSIT_FROM_ACCOUNT2:"Please note that the received amount must be deposited from the same account specified in the payment form. In case of any discrepancy, do not proceed with the release under any circumstances and inform support. If the release is carried out, the platform bears no responsibility for the released amount.",OVERPAY_CARE:"In case of discrepancy between the received amount and the payment form, do not perform the release under any circumstances and refer to the support",PRESS_WITHOUT_PAYING:"If you fill in the payment form with false information without paying and click on the payment button, your access to this service will be closed forever and the platform will claim reserves any damage caused by it",DOES_NOT_PAY_LIMITATION:"If you do not release the money after receiving the amount in your bank account, the platform can perform the release and block your access to the PaytoPay service forever.",DIGITAL_ASSETS_MENTION:"Please do not mention information about your digital assets during bank transfers. Otherwise, your payment may be intercepted or the bank may block your payment.",AVAILABLE_UNFULFILLED:"If you have unfulfilled orders or disputes with the buyer, please ensure that you are always available via the mobile phone number or email you have registered on the platform.",THIRD_CHANNELS:"You should never make a transaction with any form of money transfer through a third channel such as social networks or messengers or face-to-face transactions. The platform cannot be held responsible for damages or losses that occurred outside the platform. Also, the platform is not involved in any part of the P2P transfer.",COMMITMENT_LATER:"Users should refrain from using profanity and insulting words while using the platform. If you observe this behavior, you will be dealt with.",SHARE_ACCOUNT_WARNING:"Do not use another person's account under any circumstances. Also, do not share your account information with others. If such behavior is seen, your account will be blocked and FATA police will be informed if necessary.",AGENDA_VIOLATION:'In the event of any violation of the declared "Seller Guidelines", the Platform may, in accordance with the relevant laws and regulations, or at its discretion, take such actions as it deems appropriate, including confiscation, blocking the offending account or disabling any account functionality. to adopt in the trading platform.',THIRD_PARTY_PAYMENT_WARNING:"Only use a bank account and payment method that is registered in your name and matches your verified identity information; third-party payments are not permitted.",ASSET_LOCK_WARNING:"Once a transaction begins, the seller's assets will be locked in escrow and cannot be accessed until the order is completed or cancelled.",PAYMENT_DEADLINE_WARNING:"The buyer is required to transfer the full order amount within the specified timeframe and according to the declared payment information.",FINAL_TRANSACTION_WARNING:"P2P transactions are final; carefully review the amount, price, and payment details before placing an order.",BUYER_PAYMENT_DEADLINE:"The buyer must pay the full order amount within the specified time limit and according to the provided payment details.",RELEASE_DEADLINE_WARNING:"Please release the funds within the specified time limit. If this period expires, you will be required to respond to the buyer and the support team. If you fail to respond, the platform is authorized to release the advertised amount.",FAKE_PAYMENT_CONFIRMATION_WARNING:"If you click the \u201cPayment Completed\u201d button without making the payment and submit false information in the payment form, your access to this service will be permanently blocked. The platform reserves the right to claim compensation for any resulting damages.",OFF_PLATFORM_TRANSACTION_WARNING:"You must never transfer funds or conduct transactions through third-party channels, such as social media, messaging apps, or in-person arrangements. The platform cannot be held responsible for any loss or damage resulting from transactions conducted outside the platform. Furthermore, the platform is not involved in any part of the P2P fund transfer process."},COMMITMENT_ACCEPTION_PT_ONE:"I, {{value}}, have read the above",RULES:" commitment letter ",COMMITMENT_ACCEPTION_PT_TWO:", rules, and regulations, and I agree to them.",COMMITMENT_ACCEPTION:'I, {{value}}, have read the above <span class="username">commitment letter</span>, rules, and regulations, and I agree to them.',TERMS_COMMITMENT_AGREEMENT:"I, {{value}}, have read and agree to the <a>Terms of Service</a>.",DATE_DOT:"Date:",TIME_DOT:"Time:",PAYMENT_TO_DOT:"Payment To:",RECEIVER_PARAMETER_DOT:"Receiver: <span>{{value}} (seller)</span>",PRICE_DOT:"Price:",CARD_NUMBER_DOT:"Card Number:",ACCOUNT_NUMBER_DOT:"Account Number:",IBAN_NUMBER_DOT:"IBAN Number:",BANK_TITLE_DOT:"Bank Name:",ENTER_PAYMENT_INFORMATION:"Enter your payment information",REMAINING_TIME_DOT:"Remaining time:",ENTER_DEPOSIT_AMOUNT:"Enter the deposit amount",DEPOSIT_AMOUNT:"Deposit amount",ENTER_TRACKING_NUMBER:"Enter the tracking number",RECEIPT_IMAGE:"Receipt image (required)",UPLOAD_LIMIT_HINT:"Less than {{value}} MB",UPLOAD_LIMIT_ERROR:"Maximum file size: {{value}} MB",UPLOAD_LIMIT_TYPE:"Maximum file size: {{value}} MB",SUBMIT:"Submit",DONE_NEXT:"Done, next",EXPECTATION:"Expectation!",PAYMENT_NOTIFIED:"Dear user, your payment has been notified to the seller.",AFTER_SELLER_CONFIRMED:"After your payment is confirmed by the seller, the money will be transferred to your wallet.",WATING_SELLER_CONFIRMATION:"Dear user, your payment has been notified to the seller. To chat with the seller, you can enter this order's chat via the chat icon at the top of the page or go to My Orders list. After payment confirmation, the money will be transferred to your wallet.",NEED_TO_CONTACT_THE_SELLER:"Need to contact the seller?",ENTER_THE_ORDER_CHAT:"Enter the order chat",REMAINING_AMOUNT:"Remaining amount",MY_SALES_INFORMATION:"My purchase information",DESIRED_CURRENCY_AMOUNT:"Amount of desired currency",VALUE_NOT_ALLOWED:"The entered value is not allowed",MINIMUM_PURCHASE_PER_ORDER:"Minimum purchase per order",AD_DURATION:"Ad duration",DAY:"Day",COMPUTING:"Computing",TOTAL_REQUESTED_AMOUNT:"Total requested amount",MINIMUM_ORDER_LIMIT:"Minimum order limit",EXCHANGE_RATES_TYPES:"Types of exchange rates",FLOATING_CONVERSION_RATE:"Floating conversion rate",FINAL_RATE_CONVERTION:"Final Rate = Market Floating Conversion Rate",USER_DETERMINES_SALES_RATE:"User Determines the Sales Rate (Conversion)",FIXED_CONVERTION_RATE:"Fixed conversion rate",ATTENTION:"Attention",GUARANTEE_AMOUNT_COMPLY:"The deposit amount is considered as the user's guarantee to comply with the principles and rules of the P2P platform. This amount will be returned to your wallet after the ad is closed.",HIDDEN_AD_CASE:"Your ad will be hidden from public view in the following cases:",AD_TIME_OVER:"If the specified time for displaying the ad expires, you can delete your current ad and create a new one.",AD_REMAIN_AMOUNT:"If the remaining amount from your ad falls below the 'Minimum Purchase per Order', you can delete your ad. The remaining amount will be returned to your wallet.",ORDERS_FOR_SALE:"Your sell ad will be automatically hidden when there are 4 orders for it.",SUPPORT_AGAINST_ORDERS:"As soon as you receive 3 support requests against your orders, all your ads will be temporarily hidden.",RULES_VIOLATION_BAN:"According to the violation of the specified rules, the relevant expert can temporarily or permanently ban you from using the P2P service.",NEW_BANK_REGISTERATION:"Dear user, if you need to register new bank account information, you can",CLICK_HERE:"<span>click here</span>",GOT_IT:"Got it",RETURN_TO_WALLET_CONFIRMATION:"Return remaining amount to wallet",REMAINING_AMOUNT_TRANSFER_NOTICE:"The remaining amount of your advertisement is less than your 'minimum purchase limit'. Therefore, this remaining amount will be transferred to your wallet. Please note that your advertisement is no longer visible. You can create a new advertisement.",TRANSFER_NOTICE_CREATE:"The remaining amount of your advertisement will be transferred to your wallet. Please note that your advertisement is no longer visible. You can create a new advertisement.",CANCEL_ADVERTISEMENT:"Cancel Advertisement",DELETE_ADVERTISEMENT_WARNING:"It's not possible to delete the advertisement. First, attend to your 'In Progress' orders and complete them.",NO_BUYER_FOUND:"No buyer found",ADVERTISEMENT_CLOSED_NOTIFICATION:"Dear user, since no buyer was found within the specified time period for your advertisement, your advertisement has been closed.",CANCEL_SALE_CONFIRMATION:"Are you sure you want to cancel your sale advertisement?",YES_SALE_CONFIRMATION:"Yes",NO_SALE_CONFIRMATION:"No",MINUTES:"minutes",EDIT_INFORMATION:"editing information",MY_ORDERS:"My orders",ALL_ITEMS:"\u064eAll",RETURN_TO_MAIN:"Return to main page",AD_SUCCESSFULLY_REGISTERED:"Your ad has been successfully registered",AD_RESPONSIBILITY:"Please be responsible for your ad and if you receive a notification, take care of it as soon as possible.",PAYMENT_PERIOD:"Payment period",CARD_INFO:"Card information",DESIRED_AMOUNT:"Enter desired amount",CURRENT_RATE:"Current rate",WARNING:"Warning",I_REALIZED:"I realized",AVOID_BECOMING_VICTIM:"To avoid becoming a victim of scammers, never transfer digital currency before actual payment! Do not believe anyone who claims to be customer support and convinces you to complete the transaction before receiving payment because they are scammers. After the order is confirmed by the seller and the property is transferred to the buyer, the transaction is considered completed and cannot be disputed. Also, the platform will not be responsible for transactions outside the platform.",CHOOSE_FILE:"Choose file",ORDER_STATUS:{NEW_BUY:"Payment",NEW:"Awaiting buyer",IN_PROGRESS:"In Progress",SUPPORT:"Support",CANCEL:"Cancel",CLOSED:"Closed",DONE:"Completed"},ADVERTISE_TYPES:{BUY:"buy",SELL:"sell"},TIME_REMAINING_TO_COMPLETE_PAYMENT:"Time Remaining to Complete Payment",SUBTITLE_CHECK_TIMER:"If the Payment is Not Registered within the Specified Time, the Order Will Be Sent to Support.",REGISTER_PAYMENT_INFORMATIN:"Register payment information",ACTION_TO_RELEASE:"release",DELETE_ADVERTISMENT:"Delete Ad",DETAIL_ADVERTISMENT:"Ad details",DELETE_ORDER:"Delete Order",DETAIL_ORDER:"Order Details",BALANCE_WALLET:"Balance: {{balance}} {{currency}}",CURENTR_MARKET_RATE:"Current market rate",CURENTR_MARKET_RATE_CRYPTO:"Current market rate",YOUR_EXCHANGE_RATE:"Your exchange rate",ALLOWED_RANGE:"Allowed range: {{min}} - {{max}}",ALLOWED_RANGE_PERCENTAGE:"Allowed range: <span class='percent-range'>{{min}}% - {{max}}%</span>",ERROR_VALIDATE_ALLOWED_RANGE:"Rate must be between {{min}} and {{max}}.",ERROR_VALIDATE_ALLOWED_RANGE_PERCENTAGE:"Percentage must be between <span class='percent-range'>{{min}}% - {{max}}%</span>",TEXT_CHANGE_PERCENT_LOWER:"Your selling rate will always be {{value}}% lower than the Top Change rate.",TEXT_CHANGE_PERCENT_HIGHER:"Your selling rate will always be {{value}}% higher than the Top Change rate.",TEXT_CHANGE_PERCENT_STATIC:"Your selling rate will always be equal to the Top Change rate.",TEXT_CHANGE_PERCENT_LOWER_CRYPTO:"Your selling rate will always be {{value}}% lower than the Market rate.",TEXT_CHANGE_PERCENT_HIGHER_CRYPTO:"Your selling ra