ccess to the P2P service.",P2P_SEND_METHOD_PRICE_NOTICE:"Dear user, for amounts up to 15 million tomans, please transfer the funds via card-to-card transfer. For amounts over 15 million and up to 200 million tomans, please use an account-to-account transfer. Please note that for this method, the source and destination banks must be the same. Do not transfer funds using an IBAN."},AFFILIATE:{AFFILIATE_REQUEST:{ENTER_CODE_DESCRIPTION:"You can also be invited by someone else while being our affiliate and receive points based on the inviter's conditions.",ENTER_CODE:"Enter Referral Code",AFFILIATE_CONDITIONS:"Terms and conditions",SOCIAL_MANAGEMENT_BLOCKCHAIN:"Having social groups in the field of financial markets and currency transfers that you manage.",ONLINE_FINANCIAL_PLATFORMS:"Effective presence on social networks related to capital markets such as YouTube, Twitter, Instagram, and Telegram.",COMMUNITY_EVENTS_ATTRACTION:"Access to fan clubs, financial programs, and conferences, and the ability to create advertising space to attract new users to the TopChange platform.",CONTENT_COLLABORATION_IMPACT:"Experience and ability to generate content related to joint activities with TopChange and influence various user groups.",SEND_REQUEST:"If you want to become a member of TopChange's partnership program, click here:",SEE_FORM:"Affiliate Application Form"},AFFILIATE_SEND_REQUEST:{SEND_AFFLIATE_REQUEST:"Submit Collaboration Request",WEBSITE_ADDRESS:"Website address",SOCIAL_MEDIA:"Website or any other social media that you are a member of, such as Telegram, Twitter, etc.",COOPEREATED_COMPANY:"Previous affiliate program or company you worked with",DESCRIPTION:"Explain your strategy for collaboration (content generation, social media campaigns, email marketing, or any other advertising techniques).",ENTER_DESCRIPTION:"Write your message...",TRANSACTION_VOLUME:"Transction Volume",ESTIMATED_MONTHLY_TRADING_VOLUME:"Please write your estimated monthly trading volume in dollars.",SE