e.io",TOPCHANGE_LOOKING_FOR_SAFETY:"",TRANSFER_ANNOUNCEMENT:{TITLE:"Transfer Topchange cryptocurrencies to the GreenChange website",DESCRIPTION:"Users who have previously used the cryptocurrency services of TopChange can use the same email and password to enter GreenChange; needless of registration and authentication process. So after transferring crypto wallets you can do your exchange in GreenChange but can still use your fiat wallet in TopChange",ITEM1:"Automatic withdraw and deposit",ITEM2:"Increase transaction security",ITEM3:"Add more services in the field of cryptocurrencies"},NEW_CHANGES:{TITLE:"New changes in TopChange",BUY:{TITLE:"Buy crypto Currency",PRE_DESCRIPTION:"Charge your green change wallets via your fiat wallets in top change",DESCRIPTION:"You can recharge your cryptocurrency wallets in Green Change through Fiat wallets in TC."},SELL:{TITLE:"Sell crypto currency",PRE_DESCRIPTION:"Withdraw from green change crypto wallets and receive in your top change wallet",DESCRIPTION:"You can exchange your cryptocurrency from green change wallet to your fiat wallets in tc and receive the desired amount through withdrawal methods in TopChange .  [ Cash, Bank, etc ]"}},TRANSFER_LERANING:{TITLE:"How can i transfer my cryptocurrency wallets from TopChange to GreenChange ?",QUESTION_ONE_LOGIN_TITLE:"I had a transaction related to cryptocurrency wallets in TopChange",QUESTION_ONE_LOGIN_DESCRIPTION:"They can still use the fiat wallets in top change ; but after transferring the cryptocurrency wallets to GreenChange; they should do all exchanges related to the cryptocurrency on the green change website",QUESTION_ONE_LOGIN_BTN:"Login to GreenChange",QUESTION_ONE_REGISTER_TITLE:"I have not yet registered any request in tc regarding cryptocurrency",QUESTION_ONE_REGISTER_DESCRIPTION:"This group of users can also continue their activities on Fiat wallets in TopChange. But if they are interested in using currency exchange services, they must register and authenticate on the